msgid "What Interviewers Are Testing"
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:21122
msgid ""
"The strongest answers usually balance technical clarity with calm commercial "
"judgement."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:21124
msgid "Depth over volume."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:21125
msgid "Structured thinking under pressure."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:21126
msgid "Clear evidence of role-specific preparation."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:21130
msgid "Preparation Angles"
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:21131
msgid ""
"Prepare examples, market views, and answer structures before you try to "
"improvise in the room."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:21133
msgid "Build two or three clean stories from your experience."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:21134
msgid "Prepare one sharp reason this firm and role make sense now."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:21135
msgid ""
"Have a view on the sector or market context if the role points in that "
"direction."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:21143
#, php-format
msgid ""
"This hiring guide is built around %1$s at %2$s and focuses on what the "
"process is likely rewarding before and during application review."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:21146
msgid "What This Team Is Likely Screening For"
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:21147
msgid ""
"The brief suggests a premium on candidates who can sound credible quickly "
"and show they understand how the role fits the business."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:21149
#, php-format
msgid "Evidence of %s."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:21150
msgid "Clear fit with the level and environment."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:21151
msgid "Commercial awareness rather than generic interest."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:21155
msgid "Where Candidates Usually Misfire"
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:21156
msgid ""
"Most weak applications look underprepared, overly generic, or disconnected "
"from the actual role signals."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:21158
msgid "Generic motivation with no firm-specific context."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:21159
msgid "Experience bullets that describe tasks instead of outcomes."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:21160
msgid "No visible link between background and the live brief."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:21164
msgid "What to Prepare Before You Apply"
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:21165
msgid ""
"Tighten the application around clarity, signal, and evidence before "
"submitting anything externally."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:21167
msgid "Refine your opening CV summary."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:21168
msgid "Align your strongest examples with the role language."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:21169
msgid "Prepare a short reason this role makes sense now."
msgstr ""

