#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29626
#, php-format
msgid ""
"This benchmark matches MENA Careers’s %1$s %2$s band for %3$s. Monthly "
"figures are annualized for comparison and exclude bonus and additional "
"benefits unless stated otherwise."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29631
msgid ""
"For senior finance and investment roles, compare monthly guaranteed cash "
"first, then assess bonus, carry, schooling, relocation, medical cover, "
"flights and end-of-service terms separately."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29634
msgid ""
"Compensation moves fastest when the role owns regulated balance-sheet "
"exposure, institutional client revenue, fund/investment accountability, "
"board reporting, controls, treasury, risk or multi-entity finance leadership."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29635
msgid ""
"Packages can price above a basic role-title match when the mandate is tied "
"to major growth plans, new fund build-out, transformation, localization "
"goals, or scarce sector expertise."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29639
msgid ""
"Ask whether housing and transport are paid separately or bundled into base, "
"whether family benefits apply, and whether bonus is discretionary or formula-"
"based."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29642
msgid ""
"Anchor negotiation around the closest researched band, then justify any "
"premium with direct revenue ownership, AUM exposure, regulatory "
"accountability, team size, transformation scope or board-facing reporting."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29643
msgid ""
"For finance offers, clarify monthly guaranteed cash, annual bonus mechanics, "
"carry economics, probation terms, relocation support, schooling, medical "
"coverage, flights and end-of-service treatment before comparing headline "
"numbers."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29649
msgid "Regional deal flow"
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29650
msgid "Institutional depth"
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29652
msgid "GCC capital activity"
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29658
msgid ""
"Score reflects monthly band strength, guaranteed package clarity, seniority, "
"market scarcity and likely negotiation room before bonus and additional "
"benefits."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29741
msgid ""
"Demand is strongest where finance and private equity candidates can show "
"direct execution, investment judgement and credible senior stakeholder "
"exposure."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29742
msgid ""
"Dubai, Abu Dhabi, Riyadh, and the main GCC hubs reward direct investing, "
"portfolio work, compliance leadership, and commercially credible finance "
"operators."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29743
msgid ""
"Private equity hiring is increasingly tied to sector fluency, sharper "
"modelling and the ability to move between deal work and portfolio value "
"creation."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29744
msgid ""
"Dubai remains relevant for candidates who want regional access without "
"giving up international market visibility."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29745
msgid ""
"The strongest salary movement now comes from scarce finance, investment, "
"risk and value-creation profiles rather than generic title inflation."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29748
msgid ""
"In-demand skills include risk modelling, real estate financial modelling, "
"financial reporting, regulatory finance, budgeting, AML/CTF knowledge and "
"end-to-end deal closing."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29749
msgid ""
"Open banking, payment regulation and fintech licensing reforms are "
"increasing demand for candidates who understand both finance operations and "
"regulated digital products."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29750
msgid ""
"Corporate banking and wholesale banking hiring is being pulled by lending "
"into emerging non-oil sectors, especially where relationship managers can "
"originate and protect quality credit."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29751
msgid ""
"Alternative investment roles move quickly when candidates combine deal "
"execution, portfolio monitoring, financial modelling and sector knowledge."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29752
msgid ""
"Real estate investment pay is most sensitive to asset management exposure, "
"development underwriting, project finance, valuation discipline and "
"transaction execution."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29753
msgid ""
"Private-sector employers are under pressure to build stronger local "
"leadership benches, so roles with mentoring, succession planning and team "
"development scope can carry a premium."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29754
msgid ""
"Finance candidates who understand fast-growing non-oil sectors can stand out "
"because employers need commercial judgement, not just technical accounting "
"or modelling ability."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29755
msgid ""
"Real estate, technology, aviation, defence, hospitality, construction, "
"healthcare, alternative energy, mining and banking are all pulling finance "
"talent into more project-led and transformation-led roles."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29756
msgid ""
"Finance and accounting demand is strongest around strategic business "
"partnering, data-led planning and budgeting, project finance, scenario "
"modelling, treasury, FP&A leadership and financial control."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29757
msgid ""
"Banking and financial services roles are pricing around deal execution, "
"compliance, governance, risk, relationship management, financial modelling, "
"reporting and regulatory discipline."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29758
msgid ""
"Property and construction investors value candidates who understand "
"feasibility studies, due diligence, masterplanning, asset management, "
"leasing, full life-cycle project work and facilities economics."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29761
msgid ""
"Treat the band as a monthly guaranteed package benchmark before bonus, carry "
"and long-term upside."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29762
msgid ""
"Compare offers by mandate scope, reporting line, decision rights and package "
"clarity rather than by headline cash alone."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29763
msgid ""
"For relocations, school support, housing support, flights, medical cover and "
"move assistance can materially change the real value of an offer."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29764
msgid ""
"For private equity and adjacent investing roles, bonus structure and long-"
"term economics often matter as much as the monthly number itself."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29767
msgid ""
"Use evidence of risk modelling, board reporting, audit outcomes, liquidity "
"planning, deal execution or regulated control ownership to justify the upper "
"end of a band."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29768
msgid ""
"For banking roles, negotiate around portfolio size, client segment, revenue "
"responsibility, credit quality, team leadership and regulatory exposure."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29769
msgid ""
"For investment roles, negotiate around AUM exposure, deal volume, execution "
"ownership, IC participation, sector specialization and portfolio value "
"creation work."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29770
msgid ""
"For senior private equity operating and portfolio roles, anchor around "
"transformation scope, multi-entity complexity, reporting quality, cash "
"visibility, value creation and stakeholder influence."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29771
msgid ""
"When moving roles, pressure-test the full package rather than chasing a "
"headline uplift: base split, allowances, bonus timing, family support, "
"probation terms and retention levers all matter."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29772
msgid ""
"If an employer is trying to retain you, use competing market interest "
"carefully and anchor the discussion around replacement cost, continuity risk "
"and your measurable impact."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29773
msgid ""
"For Middle East mandates, highlight readiness to work across cross-border "
"stakeholder groups, fast-moving deals, and senior investment committees."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29782
msgid ""
"UAE private equity hiring is especially active around investment execution, "
"portfolio operations, investor relations, private credit, compliance and "
"risk."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29783
msgid ""
"Dubai remains the clearest regional bridge market for candidates balancing "
"private-market access with broader international visibility."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29784
msgid ""
"UAE compensation is usually easier to compare when broken into monthly base "
"cash, annual bonus, school support, medical cover, flights and long-term "
"incentives."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29785
msgid ""
"Many UAE private equity professionals are still expecting pay movement, but "
"employers are prioritising retention, business-critical skill gaps and "
"clearer performance cases."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29786
msgid ""
"Company values, flexible work and challenging mandates matter more in the "
"UAE than before, so total role quality is increasingly part of compensation "
"negotiation."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29787
msgid ""
"Rising housing, utilities and day-to-day living costs are keeping "
"compensation high on the agenda for UAE professionals considering a move."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29788
msgid ""
"Salary and benefits remain a major switching factor in the UAE, but senior "
"candidates also weigh work-life balance, development opportunities and "
"relocation support."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29789
msgid ""
"For relocating senior professionals, practical support such as financial "
"assistance, temporary housing and family readiness can materially affect "
"offer acceptance."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29792
msgid ""
"In-demand UAE finance skills include tax, FP&A, commercial finance, internal "
"audit, compliance, business partnering, strategic decision-making and "
"analytical communication."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29793
msgid ""
"Banking and financial services roles move fastest around compliance, "
"relationship management, business development, risk, stakeholder management, "
"negotiation and team leadership."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29794
msgid ""
"Investment, asset management and private banking roles price higher when "
"candidates bring institutional sales, client relationship ownership, fund "
"exposure, risk discipline or investment execution."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29795
msgid ""
"Technology-led finance employers value candidates who can work with AI, "
"data, cyber, digital transformation, product teams and executive decision-"
"makers."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29796
msgid ""
"UAE employers are still willing to pay for scarce senior talent, but budget "
"discipline means candidates need a stronger evidence base for the top end of "
"a band."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29797
msgid ""
"UAE skill shortages are most visible in management, leadership, analytics, "
"project management, AI, software, sales, finance and data science."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29798
msgid ""
"Finance, tax and accounting pay is being pulled by digital transformation, "
"tax compliance, FP&A, corporate finance and data-led forecasting."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29799
msgid ""
"Employers are balancing salary expectations, talent shortages, culture fit "
"and time-to-hire, so candidates who can prove fast impact have stronger "
"leverage."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29802
msgid ""
"UAE salary bands should be read as monthly basic salary benchmarks before "
"bonus and benefits unless a role explicitly states otherwise."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29803
msgid ""
"Annual bonus, school fee contribution, health insurance, hybrid working, "
"flight allowance and paid leave can materially change the real value of a "
"UAE package."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29804
msgid ""
"For senior private equity roles, check whether allowances are separate or "
"folded into base, and whether bonus is discretionary, formula-based, or "
"linked to fund and firm performance."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29805
msgid ""
"The strongest UAE offers usually combine clear mandate scope, bonus "
"visibility, health cover, schooling support where relevant and a credible "
"path to regional influence."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29806
msgid ""
"Where the monthly number is presented as a fixed package, clarify whether "
"housing, transport, mobile, schooling or other allowances are included or "
"paid separately."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29809
msgid ""
"For UAE finance leadership roles, negotiate around regional scope, reporting "
"line, transformation ownership, budgeting authority, tax exposure, controls "
"and board visibility."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29810
msgid ""
"For banking and investment roles, anchor negotiation around portfolio size, "
"revenue ownership, institutional client exposure, regulatory responsibility "
"and retention risk."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29811
msgid ""
"For Dubai roles, show evidence of commercial pace, stakeholder management "
"and cross-border execution."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29812
msgid ""
"If the employer is constrained on base salary, push for clearer bonus "
"mechanics, schooling support, hybrid flexibility, title/scope clarity or a "
"six-month salary review trigger."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29821
msgid ""
"Qatar finance salaries must be read through package structure: basic salary, "
"housing, transport, schooling, flights and bonus can change the real value "
"materially."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29822
msgid ""
"For Qatar offers, basic salary matters because it can affect family "
"sponsorship, end-of-service calculations and leave encashment."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29823
msgid ""
"Doha finance packages can look similar at headline level but feel very "
"different depending on whether housing is included, paid separately or "
"bundled into an all-inclusive number."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29824
msgid ""
"QFC-registered firms, investment platforms, asset managers and "
"internationally qualified private equity roles can sit at the upper end of "
"Qatar bands."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29825
msgid ""
"Qatar remains tax-free for personal income, so compare net take-home value "
"rather than only gross salary against high-tax markets."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29826
msgid ""
"For family moves into Doha, schooling and housing support can matter as much "
"as the base salary uplift."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29829
msgid ""
"Qatar finance pay moves higher when the role owns investment analysis, "
"portfolio oversight, fund operations, investor reporting, risk, or "
"compliance."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29830
msgid ""
"CFA, ACCA, CPA, Big Four experience, QFC exposure, bank treasury, risk and "
"compliance credentials can improve the top-end case."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29831
msgid ""
"Banking roles price around relationship ownership, treasury exposure, risk "
"management, compliance, branch leadership and institutional client coverage."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29832
msgid ""
"Senior private equity roles in Qatar become stronger when the mandate "
"includes board reporting, multi-entity control, transformation, cash "
"visibility or investor-facing work."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29833
msgid ""
"Government and semi-government investment roles can offer strong stability, "
"benefits and seniority premiums where the role is specialist or investment-"
"linked."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29836
msgid ""
"Qatar bands in MENA Careers are monthly basic salary benchmarks unless a "
"package is explicitly described as all-inclusive."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29837
msgid ""
"Always ask whether housing is separate, included in base, provided as "
"company accommodation, or expected to come out of the all-inclusive figure."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29838
msgid ""
"For family moves, clarify school fees, annual flights, medical cover, family "
"visa support and whether the basic salary clears the relevant sponsorship "
"threshold."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29839
msgid ""
"A lower basic salary with high allowances can reduce the value of end-of-"
"service and leave encashment, so protect the basic component where possible."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29842
msgid ""
"Negotiate Qatar offers by separating basic salary, housing, transport, "
"schooling, flights and bonus rather than debating one blended monthly number."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29843
msgid ""
"If the employer quotes all-inclusive compensation, test the offer against "
"realistic Doha housing and school costs before accepting."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29844
msgid ""
"Use competing GCC offers, professional qualifications, regulatory exposure, "
"relationship ownership and finance leadership scope to justify the upper end "
"of the range."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:29845
msgid ""
"For QFC, banking and investment roles, anchor negotiation around "
"international qualifications, client coverage, AUM exposure, risk ownership "
"and transaction accountability."
msgstr ""

