#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:30823
msgid ""
"Finance roles can price above wider benchmarks when the mandate supports "
"major growth plans, fund build-out, rapid hiring, or clear operating value "
"creation."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:30826
msgid ""
"Read offers as total package: base salary, bonus, carry, relocation support, "
"healthcare, pension, and any location-specific benefits."
