#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:67830
msgid "Layla · INSEAD"
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:67830
msgid ""
"A fund asked how I would assess portfolio reporting in the first 90 days. "
