#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:67831
msgid "Omar · LBS"
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:67831
msgid "How should I explain why I want to move into finance?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:67831
msgid ""
"Focus on deal exposure, ownership mindset, stakeholder judgment, and the "
"specific investing or value-creation problems you want to solve."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:67832
msgid "Noor · HEC"
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:67832
msgid ""
"What is the best way to structure Walk me through your CV for a finance "
"interview?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:67832
msgid ""
"Use a tight progression: what you owned, what scale or complexity it "
"involved, and how that makes you credible for the fund mandate."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:67832
msgid "1 hour ago"
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:67833
msgid "Rashed · CBS"
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:67833
msgid ""
"A hiring manager asked how I would review a business with slowing revenue "
"growth. Where do I start?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:67833
msgid ""
"Start with customer retention, pricing power, margin durability, and cash "
"conversion. Then test whether the slowdown is cyclical, execution-related, "
"or structural."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:67833
#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:76948
msgid "2 hours ago"
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:67834
msgid "Mariam · Oxford"
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:67834
msgid "How deep should my case model be if they only give me 45 minutes?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:67834
msgid ""
"Keep it clean: core drivers, cash flow, leverage, and a simple sensitivity. "
"Then spend your time explaining what actually moves returns."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:67834
msgid "3 hours ago"
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:67835
msgid "Hassan · Wharton"
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:67835
msgid "What should I emphasize when a fund asks why this sector?"
