#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:67835
msgid "4 hours ago"
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:67836
msgid "Zahra · IESE"
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:67836
msgid ""
"Is it enough to say I like recurring revenue businesses in a finance "
"interview?"
