msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:75621
msgid ""
"You can manage or block cookies in your browser settings. Some login, "
"security, and form features may not work correctly without essential cookies."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:75633
msgid ""
"Senna collects the information needed to provide career services, manage "
"accounts, respond to enquiries, assess career briefs, support applications, "
"and operate the website securely."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:75634
msgid "Information we collect"
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:75635
msgid ""
"This may include your name, email, current company, LinkedIn URL, submitted "
"career brief details, account activity, technical logs, CV information you "
"provide, and messages you choose to send us."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:75636
msgid "How we use it"
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:75637
msgid ""
"We use this information to assess your career needs, provide support, "
"improve applications and recommendations, protect the platform, and "
"communicate about relevant Senna services."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:75638
msgid "Your rights"
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:75639
msgid ""
"You can ask us to access, correct, update, or delete personal information "
"where applicable. Contact the Senna team using the email shown on the "
"website."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:76036
msgid "Find private equity roles, recruiter access, and clearer hiring routes"
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:76037
msgid ""
"Join MENA Careers helps candidates targeting private equity access live role "
"lists, hiring contacts, recruiter context, salary benchmarks, instant "
"alerts, and application tracking across the markets that matter most."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:76048
msgid ""
"How does MENA Careers help me find private equity roles across Dubai, Abu "
"Dhabi, Riyadh, Doha, London, and Singapore?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:76049
msgid ""
"MENA Careers organises private equity role lists by city, function, and "
"hiring route across Dubai, Abu Dhabi, Riyadh, Doha, London, and Singapore, "
"then uses your CV, target function, location signals, keywords, and "
"recruiter context to help you prioritise the roles most worth pursuing."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:76052
msgid ""
"Can I use MENA Careers if I am targeting a move into a specific market such "
"as Dubai, Abu Dhabi, Riyadh, Doha, London, or Singapore?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:76053
msgid ""
"Yes. MENA Careers helps you understand which private equity routes fit your "
"background, which city-level role lists match your target role, and which "
"recruiters or hiring contacts are connected to opportunities in Dubai, Abu "
"Dhabi, Riyadh, Doha, London, and Singapore."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:76056
msgid "Which private equity careers and markets does MENA Careers cover?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:76057
msgid ""
"MENA Careers covers private equity hiring across investing, portfolio "
"operations, investor relations, private credit, real assets, infrastructure, "
"growth equity, and adjacent buyside roles across Dubai, Abu Dhabi, Riyadh, "
"Doha, London, and Singapore."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:76060
msgid ""
"Can MENA Careers help me apply, not just find private equity role lists?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:76061
msgid ""
"Yes. Once you shortlist a private equity role in your target market, MENA "
"Careers can help with ATS keyword gaps, recruiter context, tailored "
"application materials, interview preparation, outreach angles, and tracker "
"updates so the list turns into an application pipeline."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:76064
msgid ""
"Can MENA Careers help me find private equity recruiters and hiring contacts "
"by city?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:76065
msgid ""
"Yes. MENA Careers groups recruiters, hiring managers, talent teams, and team-"
"side contacts into contact lists linked to private equity hiring across "
"Dubai, Abu Dhabi, Riyadh, Doha, London, and Singapore so you can identify "
"who is relevant before you send a message."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:76068
msgid ""
"Can I use MENA Careers to search private equity roles in Dubai, Abu Dhabi, "
"Riyadh, Doha, London, and Singapore?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:76069
msgid ""
"Yes. MENA Careers helps candidates search private equity roles and hiring "
"routes across active markets where recruiter access and timing matter."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:76072
msgid ""
"What should I add to my CV before applying for private equity roles across "
"the Middle East?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:76073
msgid ""
"Add clear dates, roles, projects, transactions, leadership scope, team size, "
"P&L ownership, tools, languages, and measurable outcomes. The clearer the "
"proof and location context, the better MENA Careers can prioritise city-"
"level role lists, contacts, and applications."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:76079
msgid "Upload profile"
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:76080
msgid ""
"Add your profile once so MENA Careers can prioritise private equity lists"
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:76081
msgid ""
"Upload a PDF, DOCX, DOC, or TXT resume in Join MENA Careers. MENA Careers "
"reads dates, experience, projects, technical skills, leadership scope, "
"sector focus, location signals, and seniority signals before ranking private "
"equity role lists and hiring contact lists across Dubai, Abu Dhabi, Riyadh, "
"Doha, London, and Singapore."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:76084
msgid "Browse job lists"
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:76085
msgid "See which private equity lists deserve your attention first"
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:76086
msgid ""
"MENA Careers compares your profile against private equity role lists across "
"Dubai, Abu Dhabi, Riyadh, Doha, London, and Singapore, then layers in "
"recruiter context and job descriptions to surface the roles that look most "
"credible for your background."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:76089
msgid "Career Report"
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:76090
msgid "Turn your current profile into a clearer private equity strategy"
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:76091
msgid ""
"Your Career Report uses your profile, matched role lists, market context, "
"and recruiter-facing signals to show which private equity routes, functions, "
"and roles to target across Dubai, Abu Dhabi, Riyadh, Doha, London, and "
"Singapore."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:76094
msgid "Recruiter contact lists"
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:76095
msgid "Find private equity recruiters and hiring contacts"
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:76096
msgid ""
"Use contact lists to inspect recruiters and hiring contacts connected to "
"private equity roles, firms, and functions in the markets where your "
