#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:81888
msgid "What is Senna?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:81889
msgid ""
"Senna is the parent brand building career infrastructure for ambitious "
"private equity candidates. The brand brings together role discovery, "
"application support, market intelligence, and membership products that help "
"candidates move faster in competitive hiring markets."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:81892
msgid "What is MENA Careers?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:81893
msgid ""
"MENA Careers is the jobs and career platform under Senna. It focuses on "
"private equity and adjacent investing roles across the Middle East, with a "
"particular focus on Dubai, Abu Dhabi, Riyadh, and Doha, plus London and "
"Singapore for global fund opportunities."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:81896
msgid "Which locations does MENA Careers cover?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:81897
msgid ""
"MENA Careers prioritises Dubai, Abu Dhabi, Riyadh, and Doha, while also "
"covering selected opportunities across the wider Middle East, London, and "
"Singapore when the role is relevant to private equity professionals."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:81900
msgid "What types of jobs are listed on MENA Careers?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:81901
msgid ""
"The platform highlights private equity, investment banking feeder roles, "
"real assets, infrastructure, growth equity, private credit, investor "
"relations, capital formation, portfolio operations, and related investing "
"roles where candidates need context, speed, and strong application materials."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:81904
msgid "How are roles organised?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:81905
msgid ""
"Roles are grouped into trackers such as private equity jobs in Dubai and Abu "
"Dhabi, private equity jobs in Riyadh, London private equity roles, Singapore "
"private equity roles, private credit, infrastructure, and portfolio "
"operations. Trackers help candidates follow the markets and job types that "
"matter most to them."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:81908
msgid "How does MENA Careers show fresh roles?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:81909
msgid ""
"Fresh private equity roles are shown with clear posting timestamps, such as "
"minutes or hours ago, so candidates can quickly see which opportunities were "
"added recently without relying on a gated 48-hour access window."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:81912
msgid "Can users get alerts for new roles?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:81913
msgid ""
"Yes. Users can request instant alerts for specific trackers so they receive "
"one focused role at a time. The alert format is designed to feel like a "
"concise, useful briefing rather than a generic jobs newsletter."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:81916
msgid "Do users need an account to browse MENA Careers?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:81917
msgid ""
"Visitors can browse the public MENA Careers experience without being forced "
"to create an account. Membership unlocks premium workflows such as tailored "
"application support, saved preferences, qualified job matching, and deeper "
"profile tools."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:81920
msgid "How is MENA Careers different from a generic job board?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:81921
msgid ""
"MENA Careers is built around focused private equity markets, curated "
"trackers, role context, market news, and application support. The aim is to "
"help candidates understand where the opportunity sits, whether it is "
"relevant, and how to move on it quickly."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:81945
msgid "About Senna and MENA Careers"
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:81946
msgid "Private equity careers, organised by Senna."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:81947
msgid ""
"Senna is the brand behind MENA Careers, a focused career platform for "
"private equity professionals looking at Dubai, Abu Dhabi, Riyadh, Doha, "
"London, Singapore, and the wider Middle East. MENA Careers brings together "
"curated jobs, tracker-based alerts, market news, and application support so "
"candidates can understand the opportunity and act quickly."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:81952
msgid "Senna: the parent brand"
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:81953
msgid ""
"Senna builds specialist career tools for candidates who need more than a "
"generic job board. The brand is focused on helping ambitious professionals "
"navigate competitive hiring markets with sharper role discovery, better "
"application materials, clearer market context, and membership products that "
"support the full career workflow."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:81956
msgid "MENA Careers: the platform"
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:81957
msgid ""
"MENA Careers is the Middle East jobs platform under Senna. It is built for "
"candidates targeting private equity and adjacent investing roles in Dubai, "
"Abu Dhabi, Riyadh, Doha, London, Singapore, and other relevant hubs. The "
"platform focuses on roles where speed, relevance, and strong positioning "
"matter."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:81960
msgid "Built around trackers"
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:81961
msgid ""
"Instead of forcing users through a broad feed, MENA Careers organises roles "
"into practical trackers. Candidates can follow focused categories such as "
"private equity jobs in Dubai and Abu Dhabi, Riyadh private equity roles, "
"London private equity roles, Singapore private equity roles, real assets, "
"infrastructure, private credit, portfolio operations, and investor relations "
"roles."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:81967
msgid "What candidates use it for"
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:81969
msgid ""
"Discover private equity and adjacent investing roles across Dubai, Abu "
"Dhabi, Riyadh, Doha, London, Singapore, and the wider Middle East."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:81970
msgid "Track focused job categories instead of browsing a noisy, generic feed."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:81971
msgid "Receive instant alerts for the role types and markets they care about."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:81972
msgid ""
"Review role context, market news, company signals, and application options "
"in one place."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:81973
msgid ""
"Use Senna membership tools for stronger CVs, tailored materials, and faster "
"applications."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:81977
msgid "Core markets and role areas"
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:81978
msgid ""
"MENA Careers is designed for markets where private capital, sovereign "
"capital, family offices, private markets, and portfolio transformation are "
"increasingly concentrated. The platform covers private equity, investment "
"banking feeder roles, real assets, infrastructure, private credit, growth "
"equity, capital formation, investor relations, portfolio operations, and "
"related investing roles."
msgstr ""

#: includes/crm/class-crm-shortcodes.php:81979
msgid ""
"The strongest focus is on Dubai, Abu Dhabi, Riyadh, and Doha because these "
"cities are central to Middle East private equity hiring. London and "
"Singapore are included for candidates targeting international funds, "
"investment platforms, and cross-border private markets roles."
msgstr ""

